WEBVTT

00:00:07.056 --> 00:00:11.060
chasing a butterfly or a car. I got out one night,

00:00:11.101 --> 00:00:13.604
By the time I had caught up with it and ate it...

00:00:13.645 --> 00:00:15.146
Probably a butterfly, then.

00:00:15.188 --> 00:00:18.149
so far away from my home, ...I realized I was

00:00:18.191 --> 00:00:20.151
I couldn't find it.

00:00:20.193 --> 00:00:24.448
Few days later, I was picked up by Animal Control.

00:00:24.489 --> 00:00:26.951
[sighs]

00:00:26.992 --> 00:00:29.119
I had a great thing going.

00:00:29.160 --> 00:00:32.122
But I had to go and mess it up.

00:00:34.041 --> 00:00:36.167
Duke, we got to go to your house!

00:00:36.209 --> 00:00:37.210
Nah.

00:00:37.252 --> 00:00:39.463
You know, yyour owner's gonna be relieved.

00:00:39.504 --> 00:00:40.839
Will he?

00:00:40.881 --> 00:00:44.802
Yeah, but-but he never came for me.

00:00:44.843 --> 00:00:47.220
Maybe he...

00:00:47.262 --> 00:00:49.180
Maybe he didn't like me.

00:00:49.222 --> 00:00:50.515
Hey, of course he liked you.

00:00:50.557 --> 00:00:52.101
He was your owner.

00:00:52.142 --> 00:00:54.478
he's probably worried sick. I mean,

00:00:54.519 --> 00:00:56.063
I don't know.

00:00:56.105 --> 00:00:57.982
Well, I do know and we're going.

00:00:58.023 --> 00:00:59.190
Your owner's gonna freak.

00:00:59.232 --> 00:01:01.443
just thinking about it. I'm freaking out

00:01:03.487 --> 00:01:04.738
Okay.

00:01:04.780 --> 00:01:06.197
Let's do it.

00:01:06.239 --> 00:01:07.491
MAN: There they are! [door opens]

00:01:07.532 --> 00:01:10.160
All right, doggy, come on. [dogs gasp]

00:01:11.870 --> 00:01:13.455
-Hey, hey, hey! -Hey! Hey!

00:01:13.497 --> 00:01:14.999
Where you think you're going?!

00:01:15.040 --> 00:01:17.208
Come back here, you dogs!

00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:19.169
[both screaming]

00:01:27.845 --> 00:01:31.222
he had crazy eyes. That rabbit--

00:01:31.264 --> 00:01:33.976
what's wrong with that thing! There ain't no curing

00:01:34.018 --> 00:01:36.227
Gidget, here's an idea. [sighs]

00:01:36.269 --> 00:01:38.689
Maybe there's a dog in the neighborhood

00:01:38.730 --> 00:01:40.440
that looks like Max.

00:01:40.482 --> 00:01:42.275
Start hanging out with him.

00:01:42.317 --> 00:01:45.403
After a while, you'll think it's him, you'll be done.

00:01:45.445 --> 00:01:48.115
We are not just giving up!

00:01:48.157 --> 00:01:49.366
We're dedicated. We're loyal.

00:01:49.407 --> 00:01:51.326
the greatest pet ever. We're easily

00:01:51.368 --> 00:01:52.410
We're dogs!

00:01:52.452 --> 00:01:54.204
-Cat. -Hawk.

00:01:54.245 --> 00:01:54.955
[chirps]

00:01:54.997 --> 00:01:56.247
Well, congratulations!

00:01:56.289 --> 00:01:58.583
whether you like it or not. Today you're dogs,

00:01:58.625 --> 00:01:59.751
Sweet.

00:01:59.793 --> 00:02:02.253
before that rabbit does. Now let's find Max

00:02:02.295 --> 00:02:03.254
Break!

00:02:03.296 --> 00:02:05.632
We're dogs!

00:02:05.674 --> 00:02:07.467
[Tiberius screeches]

00:02:07.509 --> 00:02:09.260
[laughs]

00:02:09.302 --> 00:02:10.261
[grunts]

00:02:10.303 --> 00:02:11.346
I don't like it.

00:02:11.388 --> 00:02:13.306
[grunting]

00:02:13.348 --> 00:02:15.266
Sassafras... [mutters]

00:02:15.308 --> 00:02:17.227
[sniffing]

00:02:20.230 --> 00:02:22.315
Yep, they were here.

00:02:22.357 --> 00:02:23.525
Excellent.

00:02:23.567 --> 00:02:25.027
We're closing in!

00:02:25.069 --> 00:02:27.278
This is groundbreaking evil behavior, people.

00:02:27.320 --> 00:02:28.780
Groundbreaking.

00:02:28.822 --> 00:02:31.075
[people chattering] [gasps]

00:02:33.451 --> 00:02:35.328
[sniffing]

00:02:37.288 --> 00:02:38.289
SNOWBALL: Oh!

00:02:38.331 --> 00:02:40.834
Lightbulb just went off in my brain.

00:02:40.876 --> 00:02:43.253
The bunny has an idea.

00:02:45.797 --> 00:02:47.758
Okay, so, um, how do I look?

00:02:47.799 --> 00:02:49.384
You look great.

00:02:49.426 --> 00:02:50.468
[sniffing]

00:02:50.510 --> 00:02:51.678
How do I smell?

00:02:51.720 --> 00:02:53.097
Like a dog, Duke.

00:02:53.138 --> 00:02:54.556
Relax, man.

00:02:54.598 --> 00:02:56.349
[gasps]

00:02:56.391 --> 00:02:59.061
There it is.

00:03:02.355 --> 00:03:03.815
Well, go on up.

00:03:03.857 --> 00:03:05.609
Go scratch at that door.

00:03:10.655 --> 00:03:12.616
Remember that sausage factory?

00:03:12.657 --> 00:03:14.243
That was fun, huh?

00:03:14.284 --> 00:03:15.702
Are you stalling?

00:03:15.744 --> 00:03:18.329
No. Why do you think that?

00:03:18.371 --> 00:03:21.332
Let's have a long talk about why you think I'm stalling.

00:03:21.374 --> 00:03:23.252
Duke, you have nothing to be nervous about.

00:03:23.293 --> 00:03:25.295
Your owner is gonna be thrilled to see you.

00:03:28.381 --> 00:03:30.008
Okay.

00:03:32.928 --> 00:03:36.181
Huh, that car is new.

00:03:41.436 --> 00:03:43.480
[hisses] [screams, pants]

00:03:43.521 --> 00:03:45.523
Can I help you?

00:03:47.734 --> 00:03:49.820
No. We're good, thanks.

00:03:49.861 --> 00:03:51.571
You're not good. You look dirty.

00:03:51.613 --> 00:03:54.365
And I'm gonna have to ask you to get off my lawn

00:03:54.407 --> 00:03:58.036
before I get, um, you know, what you have.

00:03:58.078 --> 00:03:59.663
This is my lawn.

00:03:59.704 --> 00:04:01.372
Duke, maybe we should go.

00:04:01.414 --> 00:04:04.375
why would Fred get a cat? And why...

00:04:04.417 --> 00:04:05.502
He hates cats.

00:04:05.543 --> 00:04:07.629
That's one of the things I love about him.

00:04:07.671 --> 00:04:10.757
Fred? The old guy?

00:04:10.799 --> 00:04:13.426
He, um...

00:04:13.468 --> 00:04:15.386
He died.

00:04:15.428 --> 00:04:16.888
[gasps softly]

00:04:16.930 --> 00:04:19.474
Duke, maybe I made a mistake saying we should come here.

00:04:19.516 --> 00:04:21.392
L-Let's... let's go.

00:04:21.434 --> 00:04:22.936
You're a liar.

00:04:22.978 --> 00:04:25.022
Max, cats lie all the time. [hissing]

00:04:25.063 --> 00:04:27.357
Don't fall for it.

00:04:32.445 --> 00:04:33.363
Who are they?

00:04:35.406 --> 00:04:36.658
[woman gasps] [Duke barks]

00:04:36.700 --> 00:04:38.409
Hey, this is my home!

00:04:38.451 --> 00:04:39.661
Go away!

00:04:39.703 --> 00:04:42.413
[barking]

00:04:42.455 --> 00:04:44.333
[phone keys beeping]

00:04:44.374 --> 00:04:47.211
Duke, it's-it's time to go.

00:04:47.252 --> 00:04:50.214
Duke, let's go. Come on!

00:04:50.255 --> 00:04:52.090
This isn't your home anymore.

00:04:52.132 --> 00:04:54.425
Why did you bring me here, Max?

00:04:54.467 --> 00:04:56.427
This is my fault? Wait a minute.

00:04:56.469 --> 00:04:58.388
I was trying to help you. You know,

00:04:58.429 --> 00:05:00.682
to get rid of me! You were trying

00:05:00.724 --> 00:05:02.976
Yeah, you know what, Duke?

00:05:03.018 --> 00:05:04.019
I don't need this.

00:05:04.061 --> 00:05:05.645
I'll see ya later.

00:05:05.687 --> 00:05:07.064
Gotcha! MAN:

00:05:07.105 --> 00:05:10.025
[grunts] Whoa, whoa, come on, come on, settle down!

00:05:10.067 --> 00:05:11.484
[Duke barks]

00:05:11.526 --> 00:05:12.777
[gasps]

00:05:12.819 --> 00:05:14.445
-Go home, Max! -Gotcha!

00:05:14.487 --> 00:05:17.157
Hey, help me out here! MAN:

00:05:17.199 --> 00:05:19.034
Hold on! I'm coming!

00:05:19.076 --> 00:05:20.035
[Duke grunts]

00:05:20.077 --> 00:05:22.287
Let's go!

00:05:22.329 --> 00:05:23.997
Finally got you, big fella.

00:05:24.039 --> 00:05:25.415
Whoa, whoa, come on. [doors close]

00:05:25.456 --> 00:05:28.126
This is it for you.

00:05:28.168 --> 00:05:30.420
[Duke barking]

00:05:32.547 --> 00:05:33.631
[gasps]

00:05:33.673 --> 00:05:34.716
Duke!

00:05:38.762 --> 00:05:40.764
[Max barking]

00:05:44.309 --> 00:05:46.061
[horns honking]

00:05:46.103 --> 00:05:47.645
[tires screeching]

00:05:47.687 --> 00:05:48.772
Whoa!

